    skos:prefLabel "2 Schedule 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2-2 ;
    values:originalText "A single day to be fixed by Proclamation. However, if any of the provision(s) do not commence within the period of 6 months beginning on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent, they commence on the first day after the end of that period." ;
