concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Application of amendment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that commence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.    (2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the rights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the rights arising under a contract entered into before the commencement of the amendment.  Schedule 1  Amendment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that commence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.    (2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the rights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the rights arising under a contract entered into before the commencement of the amendment.  Schedule 1  Amendment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "854dd91122d162204d3213cbd1f9ef86bb85d50e1ee84fb12a428cc48b588d03" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-2 ;
